    "detailed_description": "Step into the MalovModernArt Virtual Museum, a place where modern art comes alive in a world of imagination. Explore our virtual exhibition halls, showcasing 100% accurate replication of artworks. Take your time in our diverse environments, study the details, and enjoy the vibrant colors. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMalovModernArt lets you go beyond the limits of traditional galleries, offering an interactive experience. Zoom in and out, come as close as you want, and engage with the art like never before. Whether you're an art expert or just curious, our virtual museum is accessible anytime, allowing you to explore at your own pace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready for a constant stream of inspiration as we update our dynamic space with new exhibitions. MalovModernArt celebrates not just the art but the ever-changing world of creativity. Join us in experiencing the blend of art and innovation, right from your VR headset. Immerse yourself in the magic of modern art, where every gaze is a discovery, and every moment is an artistic revelation. Welcome to a world of colors and stories unfolding around you.",
    "about_the_game": "Step into the MalovModernArt Virtual Museum, a place where modern art comes alive in a world of imagination. Explore our virtual exhibition halls, showcasing 100% accurate replication of artworks. Take your time in our diverse environments, study the details, and enjoy the vibrant colors. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMalovModernArt lets you go beyond the limits of traditional galleries, offering an interactive experience. Zoom in and out, come as close as you want, and engage with the art like never before. Whether you're an art expert or just curious, our virtual museum is accessible anytime, allowing you to explore at your own pace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready for a constant stream of inspiration as we update our dynamic space with new exhibitions. MalovModernArt celebrates not just the art but the ever-changing world of creativity. Join us in experiencing the blend of art and innovation, right from your VR headset. Immerse yourself in the magic of modern art, where every gaze is a discovery, and every moment is an artistic revelation. Welcome to a world of colors and stories unfolding around you.",
